    "body_text": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "As the twin suns dipped below the horizon of Neo-Kyoto, the city transformed into a breathtaking tableau of light and shadow. Towering chrome spires, once gleaming white, now pulsed with a soft, internal luminescence, their surfaces reflecting the last streaks of violet and amber across the sky. Automated sky-taxis, their propulsion humming a low, steady thrum, wove intricate patterns through holographic advertisements that shimmered above bustling pedestrian thoroughfares. The air, thick with the scent of synthetic ozone and blooming bio-luminescent flora, carried a symphony of sounds: the gentle whir of mag-lev trains, the distant, melodic chime of public transport announcements, and the faint, ethereal strains of synth-wave music emanating from rooftop gardens, all blending into a harmonious, technological lullaby that ushered in the neon-drenched night."
      },
